  "description": "Winnovative Word to PDF Library for .NET (Classic) can be used in .NET Framework, .NET Core and .NET Standard applications on Windows to convert Word (.doc, .docx) and RTF documents to PDF.\n\nFor Windows, Linux and macOS, on x64 and ARM64, Winnovative PDF Next converts Word DOCX documents to PDF with the multi-platform package Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf and the platform packages Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.WordToPdf.MacOS.\n\nRTF documents are converted with Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf and the platform packages Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.RtfToPdf.MacOS.\n\nThe full Winnovative PDF Next library, which also converts HTML, Excel and Markdown to PDF, comes in the Winnovative.Pdf.Next, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Windows.Arm64, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux, Winnovative.Pdf.Next.Linux.Arm64 and Winnovative.Pdf.Next.MacOS packages.\n\nCompatibility:\n\n* .NET Framework 4.0 and above\n* .NET 10, 9, 8, 7, 6 and .NET Standard 2.0\n* Windows platforms\n* Azure Cloud Services and Azure Virtual Machines\n* Web, Console and Desktop applications\n\nMain Features:\n\n* Convert Word DOC, DOCX and RTF documents to PDF\n* Does not require Microsoft Word or other third-party tools\n* Convert to a memory buffer, file, stream or PDF object\n* Convert all pages or only selected pages\n* Add headers and footers with page numbering to PDF pages\n* Append or prepend external PDF files to the result\n* Password-protect and digitally sign PDF documents\n* Add graphic elements to the PDF pages\n* Generate PDF/A and PDF/X compliant documents\n* Generate CMYK and grayscale PDF documents\n* Edit, merge and split PDF documents",
